&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Ariadna</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/12/05/ariadna/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 Dec 2023 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/12/05/ariadna/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/JjpNV9tQayNV9av68"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2023-12-03-Ariadna-Horsman8x10-Fomapan400-0001-818x1024.jpg" alt="Retrat en blanc i negre d&amp;rsquo;una jove amb turbant fosc, arracades de cercle i piercing al nas, mirant a càmera." width="818" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
